arachno_project 1
title "Night Drive"
author "ArachnoTracker"
description "Rain-on-chrome melodic darkwave: FM keys, warm pads, 808 kit, gliding solo lead."
notes "F# minor | i-VI-iv-V | slow-burn night music with portamento lead and FM bells."
